              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 28:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bulemi bw'Ahazi mutabani wa Yosamu, mwijukuru wa Huliya omukama wa Yuda, Rrezini omukama wa Siriya, na Peeka mutabani wa Rremalia omukama wa Isirairi bakaseesera Yerusaalemu, baitu batasobole kurusingura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omunju ya Daudi obu bamanyisiibwe ngu Siriya eyeteeraniize na Efuraimu, Daudi hamu n'abantu be, baatukumira, nkooku orora emiti neetukumizibwa omuyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nukwo kugambira Isaaya ati: “Irooko ogende na mutabani wawe Seyara-Yasubu, mwitirane Ahazi, nimwija kumusanga haruguudo nambere abakozi b'engoye bakorra, omukura ogunyakwiha amaizi omu kiyanja eky'eruguru nambere gugarukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugambire oti: ‘Oyerinde, oculeere, otatiina, oleke kucwekwa enkizi. Ekiniga ky'omukama Rrezini n'Abasiriya, n'eky'omukama Peeka, tikirikukora kubi, okukira omwika ogurukuruga omu bicweka bibiri eby'omuti ogwomere ebirukujundeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, Siriya n'Efuraimu bacikire kukukora kubi. Bagambire bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turamagire orubuga Yuda, turutiinise, tururwanise turusingule, turwetungire, hagati yarwo tutemu Taberi nuwe abe mukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA naagamba ati: Eki tikiribaho, kandi tikirihikirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba omutwe gwa Siriya ni Damasiko kandi omutwe gwa Damasiko ni Rrezini. (Omu kasumi ak'emyaka nkaaga n'etaano, Efuraimu ericwibwa ebicweka okuruga obu, terigaruka kwetwa ihanga.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwe gw'Efuraimu, ni Samaliya, kandi omutwe gwa Samaliya ni mutabani wa Rremaliya, baitu obu mutaligumira hali nyowe, timuliguma naakake.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akarorwaho ka Imanweri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagaruka yagambira Ahazi ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Osabe MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe akuhe akarorwaho. Akarorwaho ako, karuge okuzimu omba Nyabuyonga rundi karuge omwiguru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Ahazi yagarukamu ati: “Tindukwija kusaba kandi tindukwija kulengesa MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki, Isaaya yakigarukamu ati: “Iwe enju ya Daudi, hurra! Nikibanguhira kujwahya abantu baitu, nimugira ngu kirabanguhira kujwahya na Ruhanga wange? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 1:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, MUKAMA wonyini naija kubaha akarorwaho. Akarorwaho ako, nuko kanu: omwisiki empikiirre, naija kutwara enda azaale omwana omwojo, amuruke ibara Ruhanga ali na itwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araalyaga amagita n'obwoki bw'enjoki okuhika obu alikamanya kwanga ekibi n'okwegombooza ekirungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba omwana ogu obu aliba atakamanyire kwanga ekibi n'okwegombooza ekirungi, ensi ey'abakama ababiri ab'orukutiina, eriba kifuruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naija kukuleetera, aleetere abantu bawe n'enju y'omukama yoona, ebiro eby'omuhito ogurukukira yoona eyerabaireho, okuruga obukama bwa Isirairi obu bwayahukaine ha bwa Yuda alireeta omukama w'Asiriya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, MUKAMA aliteerra orusulizo ensohera enyakuli ha nsoro z'ebisaaru bya Misiri, n'orujoki orunyakuli munsi ya Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona baliija baikale omu bihanga ebihamire, n'omunyatika ez'emyandara, ha mahwa n'omu maliisizo goona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, MUKAMA alyeta omusazi wisoke aruge obuseeri bw'ekisaaru Efuraate nuwe omulemi mukama w'Asiriya. Abamwe emireju n'isoke, n'obwoya bwona obwa ha mibiri yanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, omuntu alitunga ente ezigija emu n'entaama ibiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
