              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obusozi bwona obwalimwaga n'enfuka, toligaruka kugendayo, habw'okutiina amakerre n'amahwa; leero bulifooka kiikaro ekiraasindikwamuga ente, ekiraayeteegerwamuga, ekiraayetendigirwamuga.",
